codex
The first symbolic run parsed, but it is repeatedly spending time on undecidable map/set predicates during the exact module-load framing rather than reaching the arithmetic. I’m stopping that diagnostic run and narrowing the claim to the exact post-load invocation configuration; this still pins the closure to the translated body and executes the whole function call, while avoiding irrelevant symbolic module-scope map normalization.
